# Undying Flames (sandoria 26) at Pagisalis beside Enveloped in Darkness (C#, a container; its Pagisalis section while
# accepted: Event 48, a trade only for the velvet). The container's Event and the script alternate: at fame level 1 the
# script's call finds no quest arm (the script's own 564); accepted, the call's 565. Two lumps of beeswax: the container
# has no action for them, so the script's call plays 563 (completed).
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=136.6,6.5,131.7 job=WAR lvl=30
item LumpOfBeeswax x2
fame Sandoria 49
quest Sandoria.EnvelopedInDarkness accepted
login
trigger Pagisalis                         # Enveloped in Darkness: 48
finish
trigger Pagisalis                         # the script: Undying Flames available, fame level 1: 564
finish
trigger Pagisalis                         # 48
finish
quest Sandoria.UndyingFlames accepted
trigger Pagisalis                         # the script: 565
finish
trigger Pagisalis                         # 48
finish
trade Pagisalis LumpOfBeeswax x2          # the container has no action: the script's 563
finish                                    # completed
